@startuml
title ECS Engine Prototype - OOP vs ECS Comparison

left to right direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Same Scenario" as SameScenario {
  [Boids Parameters] as Params
  [Agent Count] as AgentCount
  [Frame Count] as FrameCount
}

package "OOP Baseline" {
  [Boid Object Array] as BoidObjects
  [Boid.update()] as BoidUpdate
  [Object Render Data] as ObjectRenderData
}

package "ECS Prototype" {
  [Entity IDs] as Entities
  [Registry] as Registry
  [View<Query Components>] as ViewQuery
  [Transform Storage] as TransformStorage
  [Velocity Storage] as VelocityStorage
  [Boid Storage] as BoidStorage
  [Renderable Storage] as RenderableStorage
  [Boid System] as BoidSystem
  [Movement System] as MovementSystem
  [Render System] as RenderSystem
  [Instance Render Data] as InstanceRenderData
}

package "Metrics" {
  [Simulation Time] as SimulationTime
  [Rendering Time] as RenderingTime
  [Frame Time] as FrameTime
  [FPS] as FPS
  [Memory Usage] as MemoryUsage
}

Params --> BoidObjects
AgentCount --> BoidObjects
FrameCount --> BoidObjects

Params --> Entities
AgentCount --> Entities
FrameCount --> Entities

BoidObjects --> BoidUpdate
BoidUpdate --> ObjectRenderData

Entities --> Registry
Registry --> TransformStorage
Registry --> VelocityStorage
Registry --> BoidStorage
Registry --> RenderableStorage
Registry --> ViewQuery
BoidSystem --> ViewQuery : View<Transform, Velocity, Boid>
MovementSystem --> ViewQuery : View<Transform, Velocity>
RenderSystem --> ViewQuery : View<Transform, Renderable>
ViewQuery --> TransformStorage
ViewQuery --> VelocityStorage
ViewQuery --> BoidStorage
ViewQuery --> RenderableStorage
RenderSystem --> InstanceRenderData

BoidUpdate --> SimulationTime
BoidSystem --> SimulationTime
MovementSystem --> SimulationTime
ObjectRenderData --> RenderingTime
InstanceRenderData --> RenderingTime
SimulationTime --> FrameTime
RenderingTime --> FrameTime
FrameTime --> FPS
BoidObjects --> MemoryUsage
TransformStorage --> MemoryUsage
VelocityStorage --> MemoryUsage
BoidStorage --> MemoryUsage
RenderableStorage --> MemoryUsage

note bottom of SameScenario
  OOP and ECS runs must use the same
  initial conditions and measurement rules.
end note

@enduml
